

### DNA extraction
Two DNA extraction protocols were used; the "extracellular" protocol and the "combined" protocol.


##### The extracellular DNA extraction protocol
This protocol targets extracellular DNA adsorbed to sediment particles. 

##### The combined DNA extraction protocol
The full "combined" protocol has been published on protocols.io _addlinkhere_
This protocol allows the retention of extracellular and intracellular ancient DNA from sediments by combining the QIAGEN DNeasy PowerSoil Pro OR QIAGEN DNeasy PowerLyzer PowerSoil kit with silica in solution DNA isolation


